            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsolda <code>false</code> görüntülenmesi için eşitlik operatörünü kullanarak <code>10</code> değerini <code>dogs</code> değişkeniyle karşılaştır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dogs\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dogs\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Dogs\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>===</code>, ardından <code>dogs</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
